49282.description:
With the ability to see the negative emotions of people, and to see it as if they&rsquo;re monsters, whose character can be different and weird, she is Deng. Because no one can understand how she feels, a wall has been built around her heart. However, after living with her innocent brother and with the help with some good friends and Karas, the person that can consume evil intensions, her world has begun to change&hellip;
<br><br>
<i>Note: Includes chapter 0 and the bonus chapter "The daily life of Kazuma".</i>

49788.description:
Kyouhei&rsquo;s father has friends who will be working overseas for a while and has offered to let their daughter stay with them, which Kyouhei opposes. Kyouhei is a fairly typical tough teenager and doesn&rsquo;t want to be shown as un-cool. Of course, Izumi, the girl who comes to live with them, rattles everything. She&rsquo;s forward, doesn&rsquo;t care about social standards and isn&rsquo;t bothered by nudity &ndash; very much as modern a girl as Kyouhei is old-fashioned. But don&rsquo;t count Kyouhei out; this is a doujo and he&rsquo;s pretty good with that practice sword&hellip; 
<br><br>
(Source: The Animeraider)
